Description: Imports, validates, analyses, and reports the adjudicated evidence,
    quality appraisal, outcome-definition taxonomy, and study overlap for an
    umbrella review of shunt-response prediction and measurement in idiopathic
    normal-pressure hydrocephalus. Review-level pooled estimates are never
    meta-meta-analysed. An optional diagnostic-accuracy module accepts only
    verified primary-study 2x2 data. Version 1.1 adds conservative outcome-
    validity adjudication, probability translation, source-consistency audits,
    claim-level categorical credibility profiles. Version 1.2 incorporates the
    final author ROBIS/AMSTAR 2 consensus, consensus-based quality sensitivities,
    final quality figures, and accepted-source/preprint-structure provenance.
